         body='// Node and BankTree: the tree: leaves with a cost and a chance, AND and OR gates\nrecord Leaf(String id, String name, double cost, double probability, String abuseCase) implements Node {\n...\nenum Kind { AND, OR }\n...\nleaf("B1", "change the account number to Ana\'s", 50, 0.9, "AC5"),',
